# cli Split Audit

File: openOODA/audit/cli_split_2026_09_13.oot
Date: 2026-09-13
Status: complete

## Goal

Split the openOODA driver surface into a thin ooda/ router and a trimmed cli/ repo. Redistribute non-language verbs to their proper homes (tui, mcp, lsp, blackbox, opm).

## Outcome

Eight phases landed. Eight governance edits plus 51 new/changed files. cli/ is a new polyrepo with its own Makefile and CI. ooda/ shrank from 56 .oo files to 4. Five downstream repos gained new handlers.

