## Files deleted

### Phase 2 (8 files)

- ooda/build/find_compiler.oo, host_build.oo, host_run.oo, test.oo, install.oo, update.oo, init.oo, qa.oo

### Phase 3 (8 files)

- ooda/fix/text.oo, apply.oo, diag.oo, fix.oo, imp.oo, must.oo
- ooda/fmt/fmt.oo
- ooda/build/context.oo

### Phase 5 (13 files)

- All 13 ooda/token/*.oo (moved to tui/token/)

### Phase 6 (5 files)

- ooda/fix/digest.oo (moved to blackbox)
- ooda/build/bench.oo, health.oo, sandbox.oo, swarm.oo (moved to blackbox)

### Phase 8 (3 files)

- ooda/build/eval.oo, gen.oo, repl.oo (deprecated; blackbox/opm equivalents shipped)

## Files written (new)

### Phase 1 — cli/ scaffold

- cli/anchor.oo, cli/main.oo, cli/Makefile, cli/README.md, cli/LICENSE, cli/.gitignore, cli/.github/workflows/ci.yml
- cli/build/anchor.oo, cli/fix/anchor.oo, cli/fmt/anchor.oo, cli/token/anchor.oo, cli/qa/anchor.oo, cli/audit/anchor.oo, cli/docs/anchor.oo, cli/examples/anchor.oo

