## Files updated

### Phase 0 — governance

- openOODA/openOODA/rules.oot (§1.14 N-Binary; cli/ in polyrepo list; §1.23 Operational Logistics adds cli/)
- openOODA/openOODA/roadmap.oot (§2 Phase 2 split into cli driver + ooda router)
- openOODA/openOODA/requirements.oot (R2 -> R2a cli driver + R2b ooda router)

### Phase 2

- ooda/main.oo (121 -> 106 lines; rewritten as thin router)
- ooda/build/anchor.oo (slimmed: only spawn.oo + 8 deprecated handlers)

### Phase 3

- cli/main.oo (98 -> 127 lines; wires 12 real verbs)
- ooda/build/anchor.oo (slimmed again: 7 deprecated after context.oo removal)

### Phase 5

- tui/anchor.oo (imports token/anchor.oo; api_surface=2)
- tui/main.oo (added --token <sub> flag handler)
- cli/main.oo (wires token forwarder)

### Phase 6

- blackbox/cli/cli_run.oo (cli_help lists 5 new verbs; cli_dispatch calls cli_dispatch_more at end)
- blackbox/cli/main.oo (signature adds TimeCap + ThreadCap)
- blackbox/cli/anchor.oo (imports 5 new + cli_dispatch_more)

### Phase 7

- opm/cli/main.oo (imports cmd_gen.oo; dispatch adds gen)

### Phase 8

- ooda/build/anchor.oo (slimmed to only spawn.oo)
- ooda/build/ no longer has bench, context, eval, gen, health, repl, sandbox, swarm

## Repos touched

1. openOODA/openOODA (governance)
2. openOODA/ooda (router trim; 56 -> 4 .oo files)
3. openOODA/cli (NEW polyrepo; 14 skeleton + 12 moved handlers)
4. openOODA/tui (token/ moves in; --token <sub> flag added)
5. openOODA/blackbox (5 new diagnostic handlers + cli_dispatch_more)
6. openOODA/opm (1 new gen handler)

## Repos not touched

- openOODA/oodac, openOODA/oodar, openOODA/std, openOODA/lsp, openOODA/mcp, openOODA/install, openOODA/catalog

## Back-compat matrix

| Old `ooda <sub>` | New home | Back-compat status |
|---|---|---|
| `build <file>` | `cli build <file>` | ooda forwards via spawn |
| `run <file>` | `cli run <file>` | ooda forwards via spawn |
| `test <file>` | `cli test <file>` | ooda forwards via spawn |
| `fmt <file>` | `cli fmt <file>` | ooda forwards via spawn |
| `install` | `cli install` | ooda forwards via spawn |
| `update`/`upgrade` | `cli update` | ooda forwards via spawn |
| `init` | `cli init` | ooda forwards via spawn |
| `qa` | `cli qa` | ooda forwards via spawn |
| `context` | `cli context` | ooda forwards via spawn |
| `fix` | `cli fix` | ooda forwards via spawn |
| `token <sub>` | `cli token <sub>` -> `ooda-tui --token <sub>` | ooda forwards -> cli forwards -> ooda-tui |
| `eval`/`repl` | (dead; use ooda-tui shell) | ooda prints "moved" + exit 2 |
| `bench` | `blackbox bench` | ooda prints "moved" + exit 2 |
| `gen` | `opm gen <Kind> <Name>` | ooda prints "moved" + exit 2 |
| `health` | `blackbox health` | ooda prints "moved" + exit 2 |
| `digest` | `blackbox digest` | ooda prints "moved" + exit 2 |
| `sandbox <sub>` | split: status->blackbox, run->ooda-tui | ooda prints "moved" + exit 2 |
| `swarm <sub>` | split: status->blackbox, init/run->ooda-tui | ooda prints "moved" + exit 2 |
| `opm` | `opm <sub>` (spawned) | unchanged |
| `lsp` | `lsp` (spawned) | unchanged |
| `mcp` | `mcp` (spawned) | unchanged |
| `mcp-merge` | `ooda-mcp mcp-merge` (spawned) | ooda forwards |

## Verification

- cli/ `make verify`: PASS (256-line cap, file law, academy headers)
- ooda/ Academy header check: all .oo files valid
- tui/ Phase 5 wiring: --token flag parses; cmd_token dispatch wired
- blackbox/ Phase 6: 5 new verbs wired through cli_dispatch_more; help text updated
- opm/ Phase 7: gen <Kind> <Name> dispatches to cmd_gen; refuses .. and /

