## Acceptance

Plan §6.1 per-repo acceptance: all .oo files <= 256 lines; Academy headers in first 7 lines; anchors in every directory; binary parity deferred to Phase 8 follow-up (requires oodac to compile cli/main.oo).

Plan §6.2 cross-repo: back-compat preserved via ooda router; double-run discipline deferred to Phase 8 follow-up (requires binary builds); file law + line cap + Academy headers all green.

Plan §6.3: this audit log is the migration record. Each phase PR can reference this file as the single source of truth.
